    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dynasthir is a dark ages inspired 3rd-person A-RPG, with an obscure world and deadly kinetic combat fueled by adrenaline.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In its dying breath, Dynasthir beckons. Bestowed upon you is a vast obscure world inviting methodical exploration, skillful combat &amp; profound moments of awe. Push into the unknown &amp; maybe you'll live to tell your tale.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras/28ac2d1ca36ffb767b998b1596a3c602.poster.avif?t=1745789075\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras/28ac2d1ca36ffb767b998b1596a3c602.webm?t=1745789075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras/28ac2d1ca36ffb767b998b1596a3c602.mp4?t=1745789075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynasthir delivers</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rewarding combat, through skill and planning </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn skills from observation &amp; action in combat</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world reacting to your actions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intricate skill-tree</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons &amp; miasma </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep traversal mechanics in a perilous world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The world is dying, will you </strong><strong><i>persist?</i></strong></p>",
